            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "Mike P",
        "text": "Alright I'm done dude.  Today changed the entire AI game again.  Throwing my Mac mini in the trash. Deleting all my subs and just maxing out Grok Bot.\n\nYou don't need anything else anymore. I made this video by opening Grok Bot, and spending about 15 seconds writing the following prompt:\n\n\"Make me an explainer video on the natural gas supply chain for residential service, from where gas is generated to the delivery line into your home. Talk about how pressure is stepped down at each stop along the way, how lines are run, etc\"\n\nGrok Bot is just a magic box that you write a little bit of English into and get out gold. I'm done with everything else.  I don't care anymore.\n\nMy goal with these videos is to help people understand that the simplest things they take for granted are actually very complex, and you should be amazed by everything basically.",
