        "name": "X Freeze",
        "text": "Elon Musk explains why Starlink will actually increase the GDP of entire countries\n\n“If you don’t have access to the internet, or it’s too expensive or low bandwidth, you cannot access MIT lessons, you can’t access information, and you can’t sell your goods and services”\n\nStarlink changes that\n\n“Starlink will actually move the GDP of countries. It’s going to be that kind of thing”\n\nBecause connectivity unlocks far more than internet access\n\nIt gives people access to education, information, jobs, customers and global markets\n\nWhen millions of people become more productive and economically connected, the impact will show up across an entire country\n https://x.com/XFreeze/status/2060107390234898789/video/1",
